<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Fiduciary Duty & Ethics Acknowledgment - {{officer.fullName}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 12pt;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #111;
      padding: 40px;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 16pt;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 13pt;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    p {
      margin: 12px 0;
    }
    .signature-section {
      margin-top: 60px;
      border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
      padding-top: 30px;
    }
    .signature-line {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
      width: 300px;
      margin: 30px 0 5px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Fiduciary Duty & Ethics Acknowledgment</h1>

  <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{currentDate}}</p>
  <p><strong>Officer:</strong> {{officer.fullName}}</p>
  <p><strong>Title:</strong> {{title}}</p>
  <p><strong>Company:</strong> {{company.legalName}}</p>

  <h2>Fiduciary Duties</h2>
  <p>I, <strong>{{officer.fullName}}</strong>, acknowledge that as an officer and/or director of {{company.legalName}} (the "Corporation"), I owe the following fiduciary duties to the Corporation and its shareholders:</p>

  <h3>1. Duty of Care</h3>
  <p>I shall perform my duties in good faith, in a manner I reasonably believe to be in the best interests of the Corporation, and with the care an ordinarily prudent person in a like position would use under similar circumstances.</p>

  <h3>2. Duty of Loyalty</h3>
  <p>I shall act in the best interests of the Corporation and its shareholders, avoiding conflicts of interest and self-dealing, and placing the interests of the Corporation above my personal interests.</p>

  <h3>3. Duty of Obedience</h3>
  <p>I shall comply with all applicable laws, regulations, the Certificate of Incorporation, the Bylaws, and corporate policies.</p>

  <h3>4. Duty of Confidentiality</h3>
  <p>I shall maintain the confidentiality of all non-public corporate information and shall not use such information for personal gain or disclose it without authorization.</p>

  <h2>Ethics Commitment</h2>
  <p>I commit to upholding the highest standards of ethical conduct, including:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>Acting with honesty, integrity, and transparency in all corporate matters</li>
    <li>Avoiding actual, potential, or perceived conflicts of interest</li>
    <li>Refraining from self-dealing or using corporate assets for personal benefit</li>
    <li>Treating all stakeholders with respect, dignity, and professionalism</li>
    <li>Promptly disclosing any material information that may affect the Corporation</li>
    <li>Cooperating fully with internal audits, investigations, and compliance reviews</li>
    <li>Supporting a culture of accountability, ethical behavior, and corporate responsibility</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Acknowledgment of Consequences</h2>
  <p>I understand that breach of fiduciary duty or ethical standards may result in:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Personal liability for damages to the Corporation or its shareholders</li>
    <li>Removal from office for cause</li>
    <li>Forfeiture of compensation, equity, or other benefits</li>
    <li>Legal action, including civil or criminal proceedings</li>
    <li>Reputational damage and loss of professional standing</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Ongoing Obligation</h2>
  <p>I acknowledge that these fiduciary duties and ethical obligations are ongoing and continue throughout my service as an officer and/or director of the Corporation, and in certain respects (such as confidentiality and non-compete), may extend beyond the termination of my service.</p>

  <div class="signature-section">
    <p>IN WITNESS WHEREOF, I have executed this Fiduciary Duty & Ethics Acknowledgment as of the date first written above.</p>
    
    <div class="signature-line"></div>
    <p><strong>{{officer.fullName}}</strong><br />{{title}}</p>
    
    <div class="signature-line"></div>
    <p><strong>Date</strong></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
